From ca4dbde3cfb8cb15b4f2516a588aa2be49b30b6e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:55:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] test-posix: Check the rest of <sys/mman.h>

The header's names and its strict namespace; mapping, replacing and
removing pages and the signals that follow; sharing across fork; file
mappings past the end of the file; mprotect and msync on whole pages;
posix_madvise leaving contents alone; mlockall flags; shm_open flags,
descriptors, permissions, atomic creation, names and unlinking; and the
errors of each.
